title: "Feigenbaum Universality in Quantum Computing"
version: "1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.17834056"
url: "https://github.com/poig/self-research"
abstract: |
  This repository contains a series of pre‑prints and code exploring Feigenbaum universality in quantum measurement dynamics, chaos control for variational quantum algorithms, and scaling structures as quantum resources.
keywords:
  - Feigenbaum
  - quantum measurement
  - chaos control
  - variational quantum algorithms
  - scaling structure
